					"language": "plaintext",
					"showLineNumbers": false,
					"showMiniMap": false
				},
				"content": "<style>\n  @font-face {font-family: 'Quicksand';src: url(\"public/fonts/Quicksand.woff2\") format('woff2')}\n</style>\n<div style=\"color:#548343; font-weight:bold; background-color:#b8bb62; font-size:larger;\">\n  &nbsp;Grimstad OAQ comparison with physical device \n</div>\n<div style=\"color:#548343; font-weight:normal;\">\n  The location of <b>Grimstad</b> does not guarantee very precise outdoor air quality measurements through an external provider, which is why a physical device, brand Kunak, has been installed. \n  This board allows to compare directly both series of measurements.<br>\n  <span style=\"color:#fbcb09;\">More info about manipulating pannels in the <a href=\"/d/home/\">Home screen</a></span>\n</div>",
				"mode": "markdown"
			},
			"pluginVersion": "11.1.3",
			"transparent": true,
			"type": "text"
		},
